    "heading": "2. SCOPE AND KEY CONCEPTS",
    "html": "<p>2.1. Geographic scope: The App is primarily intended for users from EU Member States, the United Kingdom, Norway, Iceland, Liechtenstein and Switzerland. When used from another jurisdiction, processing takes place in accordance with the GDPR. 2.2. Data subject: You, as a natural person who downloads, installs, creates an Account or otherwise uses the App, whether in &quot;Use without Registration&quot; mode or as a Registered user. 2.3. Key difference between the modes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>Use without Registration: The App works without creating an Account; basic features are available (map, prices, navigation, Quality Stations, Fuel Quality in read-only). Processed data is limited to technical device identifiers (install_id, a UUID generated by the App), preference setngs (language, currency) and pseudonymized analytical data. This is NOT an anonymous Supabase account; a formal user account in our database (auth.users) is created only upon registration.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Registered Account: A full account including a name/nickname, email and other data necessary for participation in the PHM Cash Program, the PusHMe service, Community Price Reports, the creation of Community Stations, Fuel Quality ratings and Flash Offer redemption.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n"
